solution:
解 按气体分子算术平均速率公式 $\bar{v}=\sqrt{\frac{8 R T}{\pi M}}$ 算得 $\bar{v}=1.70 \times 10^{3} \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s}$ ，按 $p=n k T$ 算得单位体积中分子数 $n=2.69 \times 10^{25} \mathrm{~m}^{-3}$ ，因此

$$
\begin{gathered}
\bar{\lambda}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2} \pi d^{2} n}=2.10 \times 10^{-7} \mathrm{~m} \quad(\text { 约为分子直径的 } 1000 \text { 倍 }) \\
\bar{Z}=\frac{\bar{v}}{\bar{\lambda}}=8.10 \times 10^{9} \mathrm{~s}^{-1}
\end{gathered}
$$

即在标准状态下，在 1 s 内，一个氢分子的平均碰撞次数约有 80 亿次。

Solution: Using the formula for the arithmetic average speed of gas molecules, $\bar{v}=\sqrt{\frac{8 R T}{\pi M}}$, we calculate $\bar{v}=1.70 \times 10^{3} \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s}$. Using $p=n k T$, we calculate the number of molecules per unit volume as $n=2.69 \times 10^{25} \mathrm{~m}^{-3}$. Therefore,

$$
\begin{gathered}
\bar{\lambda}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{2} \pi d^{2} n}=2.10 \times 10^{-7} \mathrm{~m} \quad(\text { approximately 1000 times the molecular diameter }) \\
\bar{Z}=\frac{\bar{v}}{\bar{\lambda}}=8.10 \times 10^{9} \mathrm{~s}^{-1}
\end{gathered}
$$

That is, under standard conditions, the average number of collisions for a hydrogen molecule in 1 second is about 8 billion.

