\end{gathered}
$$
The trajectory of motion is a straight line, so it is linear motion; the velocity changes with time, so it is non-uniform motion; the acceleration is a constant vector, so it is uniformly accelerated motion; therefore, the particle undergoes uniformly accelerated linear motion.

