(i) First, let us calculate

$$
\begin{aligned}
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{2} & \equiv\left(c_{x} \sigma_{x}+c_{y} \sigma_{y}+c_{z} \sigma_{z}\right)\left(c_{x} \sigma_{x}+c_{y} \sigma_{y}+c_{z} \sigma_{z}\right) \\
& =c_{x}^{2} \sigma_{x}^{2}+c_{y}^{2} \sigma_{y}^{2}+c_{z}^{2} \sigma_{z}^{2}+c_{x} c_{y}\left\{\sigma_{x}, \sigma_{y}\right\}+c_{y} c_{z}\left\{\sigma_{y}, \sigma_{z}\right\}+c_{z} c_{x}\left\{\sigma_{z}, \sigma_{x}\right\}
\end{aligned}
$$

From the results of the previous problem, this expression is just

$$
c_{x}^{2} \mathrm{I}+c_{y}^{2} \mathrm{I}+c_{z}^{2} \mathrm{I} \equiv c^{2} \mathrm{I}
$$

where $c$ is the modulus of the vector $\mathbf{c}$. Now we can use this result to calculate the expression (i):

$$
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n}= \begin{cases}{\left[(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{2}\right]^{n / 2}=\left(c^{2} \mathrm{I}\right)^{n / 2} \equiv c^{n} I,} & \text { for even } n \\
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n-1} \mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}=\left(c^{n-1} \mathrm{I}\right) \mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} \equiv c^{n} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}, & \text { for odd } n\end{cases}
$$

(ii) Here we can first use the binomial theorem and then the above result for the expression (i):

$$
(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n}=\sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k}(b \mathrm{I})^{n-k}(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{k}=\sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} \times \begin{cases}c^{k} \mathrm{I}, & \text { for even } k \\
c^{k} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}, & \text { for odd } k\end{cases}
$$

Now we may use the sign-alternating property of the factor $(-1)^{k}$ to represent this sum in the following, more regular form:

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} c^{k}\left[\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}+(-1)^{k} \frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}\right] \\
& \quad=\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2} \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} c^{k}+\frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2} \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k}(-c)^{k}
\end{aligned}
$$

This trick enables us to apply the binomial theorem again, now backwards, to each of the two sums on the right-hand side of the last equality, and get the final result in a more compact form:

$$
\begin{aligned}
(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n} & =\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}(b+c)^{n}+\frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}(b-c)^{n} \\
& =\frac{(b+c)^{n}+(b-c)^{n}}{2} \mathrm{I}+\frac{(b+c)^{n}-(b-c)^{n}}{2} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}
\end{aligned}
$$

Note that this result is very general (and hence very important), because any $2 \times 2$ matrix may be represented in the form $(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})$-see Eq. (4.106) of the lecture notes.

(i) 首先，让我们计算

$$
\begin{aligned}
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{2} & \equiv\left(c_{x} \sigma_{x}+c_{y} \sigma_{y}+c_{z} \sigma_{z}\right)\left(c_{x} \sigma_{x}+c_{y} \sigma_{y}+c_{z} \sigma_{z}\right) \\
& =c_{x}^{2} \sigma_{x}^{2}+c_{y}^{2} \sigma_{y}^{2}+c_{z}^{2} \sigma_{z}^{2}+c_{x} c_{y}\left\{\sigma_{x}, \sigma_{y}\right\}+c_{y} c_{z}\left\{\sigma_{y}, \sigma_{z}\right\}+c_{z} c_{x}\left\{\sigma_{z}, \sigma_{x}\right\}
\end{aligned}
$$

根据之前问题的结果，该表达式就是

$$
c_{x}^{2} \mathrm{I}+c_{y}^{2} \mathrm{I}+c_{z}^{2} \mathrm{I} \equiv c^{2} \mathrm{I}
$$

其中 $c$ 是向量 $\mathbf{c}$ 的模。现在我们可以利用这个结果来计算表达式 (i):

$$
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n}= \begin{cases}{\left[(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{2}\right]^{n / 2}=\left(c^{2} \mathrm{I}\right)^{n / 2} \equiv c^{n} I,} & \text { 对于偶数 } n \\
(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n-1} \mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}=\left(c^{n-1} \mathrm{I}\right) \mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} \equiv c^{n} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}, & \text { 对于奇数 } n\end{cases}
$$

(ii) 在这里，我们可以先使用二项式定理，然后使用上述结果来处理表达式 (i):

$$
(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n}=\sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k}(b \mathrm{I})^{n-k}(\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{k}=\sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} \times \begin{cases}c^{k} \mathrm{I}, & \text { 对于偶数 } k \\
c^{k} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}, & \text { 对于奇数 } k\end{cases}
$$

现在我们可以利用因子 $(-1)^{k}$ 的交替符号性质，将此和表示为以下更规则的形式：

$$
\begin{aligned}
& \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} c^{k}\left[\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}+(-1)^{k} \frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}\right] \\
& \quad=\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2} \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k} c^{k}+\frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2} \sum_{k=0}^{n}{ }^{n} C_{k} b^{n-k}(-c)^{k}
\end{aligned}
$$

这个技巧使我们可以再次向后应用二项式定理，针对最后一个等式右侧的两个和，得到一个更紧凑形式的最终结果：

$$
\begin{aligned}
(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})^{n} & =\frac{\mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}(b+c)^{n}+\frac{\mathrm{I}-\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma} / c}{2}(b-c)^{n} \\
& =\frac{(b+c)^{n}+(b-c)^{n}}{2} \mathrm{I}+\frac{(b+c)^{n}-(b-c)^{n}}{2} \frac{\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma}}{c}
\end{aligned}
$$

注意，这个结果非常通用（因此非常重要），因为任何 $2 \times 2$ 矩阵都可以表示为 $(b \mathrm{I}+\mathbf{c} \cdot \boldsymbol{\sigma})$ 的形式——参见讲义的方程 (4.106)。

Let the four-momentum of the unknown particle be $P$, and the four-momenta of the electron before and after the scattering be $k$ and $k^{\prime}$. After the scattering, the incoming particle will have four-momentum $P^{\prime}$. With a convenient choice of the reference frame, we can write:

$$
\begin{aligned}
P & =\left(\sqrt{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}+M^{2}},|\mathbf{p}|, 0,0\right) \\
k & =\left(m_{e}, 0,0,0\right) \\
k^{\prime} & =\left(E_{e}, \sqrt{E_{e}^{2}-m_{e}^{2}} \cos \theta_{e}, \sqrt{E_{e}^{2}-m_{e}^{2}} \sin \theta_{e}, 0\right) \\
P^{\prime} & =P+k-k^{\prime}
\end{aligned}
$$

Squaring the last of Eq. (1.145), we get rid of the unknown kinematics, obtaining:

$$
\begin{aligned}
P^{\prime 2} & =P^{2}+2 P k-2 P k^{\prime}+k^{2}+k^{\prime 2}-2 k k^{\prime} \\
M^{2} & =M^{2}+2\left(m_{e}-E_{e}\right) \sqrt{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}+M^{2}}+2|\mathbf{p}| \sqrt{E_{e}^{2}-m_{e}^{2}} \cos \theta_{e}+2 m_{e}\left(m_{e}-E_{e}\right) \\
0 & =\sqrt{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}+M^{2}}-|\mathbf{p}| \sqrt{\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}}} \cos \theta_{e}+m_{e} \\
0 & =\sqrt{1+\frac{M^{2}}{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}}}-\sqrt{\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}}} \cos \theta_{e}+\frac{m_{e}}{|\mathbf{p}|} \\
M & \approx|\mathbf{p}|\left[\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}} \cos ^{2} \theta_{e}-1\right]^{\frac{1}{2}}=|\mathbf{p}|\left[\frac{T_{e}+2 m_{e}}{T_{e}} \cos ^{2} \theta_{e}-1\right]^{\frac{1}{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$

where the factor $m_{e} /|\mathbf{p}|$ has been neglected, and we have introduced the kinetic energy $T_{e}=E_{e}-m_{e}$.

设未知粒子的四动量为 $P$，散射前后的电子四动量为 $k$ 和 $k^{\prime}$。散射后，入射粒子的四动量为 $P^{\prime}$。通过方便的参考系选择，我们可以写成：

$$
