P^{\prime} & =P+k-k^{\prime}
\end{aligned}
$$

对方程(1.145)的最后一个平方，我们消除了未知的运动学，得到：

$$
\begin{aligned}
P^{\prime 2} & =P^{2}+2 P k-2 P k^{\prime}+k^{2}+k^{\prime 2}-2 k k^{\prime} \\
M^{2} & =M^{2}+2\left(m_{e}-E_{e}\right) \sqrt{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}+M^{2}}+2|\mathbf{p}| \sqrt{E_{e}^{2}-m_{e}^{2}} \cos \theta_{e}+2 m_{e}\left(m_{e}-E_{e}\right) \\
0 & =\sqrt{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}+M^{2}}-|\mathbf{p}| \sqrt{\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}}} \cos \theta_{e}+m_{e} \\
0 & =\sqrt{1+\frac{M^{2}}{|\mathbf{p}|^{2}}}-\sqrt{\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}}} \cos \theta_{e}+\frac{m_{e}}{|\mathbf{p}|} \\
M & \approx|\mathbf{p}|\left[\frac{E_{e}+m_{e}}{E_{e}-m_{e}} \cos ^{2} \theta_{e}-1\right]^{\frac{1}{2}}=|\mathbf{p}|\left[\frac{T_{e}+2 m_{e}}{T_{e}} \cos ^{2} \theta_{e}-1\right]^{\frac{1}{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$

其中因子 $m_{e} /|\mathbf{p}|$ 被忽略了，并且我们引入了动能 $T_{e}=E_{e}-m_{e}$。

The cosmic microwave background (CMB) features a black-body spectrum with temperature $T \approx 2.7 \mathrm{~K}$. The energy density per unit of frequency is given by Planck's law

$$
\frac{d E}{d v}=\frac{8 \pi h}{c^{3}} \frac{v^{3}}{\exp \left(h v / k_{\mathrm{B}} T\right)-1}
$$

The peak frequency mode has an energy of about $3 k_{\mathrm{B}} T$, so that:

$$
\begin{aligned}
& 3 k_{\mathrm{B}} T=h \bar{v}=\frac{h c}{\bar{\lambda}}, \quad \bar{\lambda}=\frac{h c}{3 k_{\mathrm{B}} T}= \\
& =\frac{6.6 \times 10^{-34} \mathrm{~J} \mathrm{~s} \cdot 3 \times 10^{8} \mathrm{~m} \mathrm{~s}^{-1}}{3 \cdot 8.6 \times 10^{-5} \mathrm{~K}^{-1} \cdot 1.6 \times 10^{-19} \mathrm{~J} \cdot 2.7 \mathrm{~K}} \approx 1.7 \mathrm{~mm}
\end{aligned}
$$

corresponding to a frequency $\bar{v}=160 \mathrm{GHz}$. The typical radiation spectrum is therefore located in the microwave domain.

