& =\frac{\partial^{2} A_{z}}{\partial x \partial y}-\frac{\partial^{2} A_{y}}{\partial x \partial z}+\frac{\partial^{2} A_{x}}{\partial y \partial z}-\frac{\partial^{2} A_{z}}{\partial y \partial x}+\frac{\partial^{2} A_{y}}{\partial z \partial x}-\frac{\partial^{2} A_{x}}{\partial z \partial y}
