The condition for the constructive interference in the reflected light or for the brightness of soap bubble film is $2 \mu t \cos r=(2 n-1) \lambda / 2$, where $n=1,2,3, \ldots$
If the light is incident normally on the film, then

$$
\begin{aligned}
r & =0 \text { and } \cos r=1 \\
\therefore \quad 2 \mu t & =(2 n-1) \lambda / 2 \text { or } t=\frac{(2 n-1) \lambda}{4 \mu}
\end{aligned}
$$

For the least thickness of the film, $n=1$
$\therefore$ least thickness of the film, $t=\frac{\lambda}{4 \mu}=\frac{6000}{4 \times 1.46}=1027.4 \AA$

肥皂泡薄膜中反射光的相长干涉条件或薄膜的亮度条件是 $2 \mu t \cos r=(2 n-1) \lambda / 2$，其中 $n=1,2,3, \ldots$。如果光垂直入射到薄膜上，那么

$$
\begin{aligned}
r & =0 \text { 且 } \cos r=1 \\
\therefore \quad 2 \mu t & =(2 n-1) \lambda / 2 \text { 或 } t=\frac{(2 n-1) \lambda}{4 \mu}
\end{aligned}
$$

对于薄膜的最小厚度，$n=1$
$\therefore$ 薄膜的最小厚度，$t=\frac{\lambda}{4 \mu}=\frac{6000}{4 \times 1.46}=1027.4 \AA$

The dispersive power or the angular dispersion produced by a grating around a mean wavelength $\lambda$ is given by

$$
\frac{d \theta}{d \lambda}=\frac{n \lambda}{(a+b) \cos \theta} \text { or } \frac{d \theta}{d \lambda}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(\frac{a+b}{n}\right)^{2}-\lambda^{2}}}
$$

where $(a+b)$ is the grating element and $n$ is the order of spectra.
Here, for the first order, that is, for $n=1, \lambda=5000 \AA$ and $(a+b)=18000 \AA$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\therefore \quad \frac{d \theta}{d \lambda} & =\frac{1}{\sqrt{(18000)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{\left[(18)^{2}-(5)^{2}\right]}} \\
& =\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{299}}=5.78 \times 10^{-3} \mathrm{rad}(\AA)^{-1}
\end{aligned}
$$

Similarly for third order, that is, for $n=3$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{d \theta}{d \lambda} & =\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(\frac{18000}{3}\right)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{(6000)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{11}} \\
& =3.0 \times 10^{-4} \mathrm{rad}(\AA)^{-1}
\end{aligned}
$$

光栅在平均波长 $\lambda$ 处产生的色散能力或角色散由以下公式给出：

$$
\frac{d \theta}{d \lambda}=\frac{n \lambda}{(a+b) \cos \theta} \text{ 或 } \frac{d \theta}{d \lambda}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(\frac{a+b}{n}\right)^{2}-\lambda^{2}}}
$$

其中 $(a+b)$ 是光栅元素，$n$ 是光谱的级次。
在这里，对于一级光谱，即 $n=1, \lambda=5000 \AA$ 和 $(a+b)=18000 \AA$，有

$$
\begin{aligned}
\therefore \quad \frac{d \theta}{d \lambda} & =\frac{1}{\sqrt{(18000)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{\left[(18)^{2}-(5)^{2}\right]}} \\
& =\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{299}}=5.78 \times 10^{-3} \mathrm{rad}(\AA)^{-1}
\end{aligned}
$$

类似地，对于三级光谱，即 $n=3$，有

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{d \theta}{d \lambda} & =\frac{1}{\sqrt{\left(\frac{18000}{3}\right)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{(6000)^{2}-(5000)^{2}}}=\frac{1}{10^{3} \sqrt{11}} \\
& =3.0 \times 10^{-4} \mathrm{rad}(\AA)^{-1}
\end{aligned}
$$

